# While the Cat is Away (WotG 5): the update with option 1 answers nothing; the finish completes the mission.
lists EastRonfaureS/onZoneIn/1 EastRonfaureS/onEventUpdate/7 EastRonfaureS/onEventFinish/7
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=100.801,1,103.211 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov Cauterize current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg WhileTheCatIsAway current
login
warp 322,-60,503 EastRonfaureS open
update 7 option=1
finish
